WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:11.300
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.800
Open the task that has to wait

3
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.400
Tap Edit

4
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.600
Pull the form up to Depends On

5
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.100
Under Depends On, tap Add

6
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.800
Tick the task it waits for

7
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.200
Done

8
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.800
Save

9
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.200
The task shows what it's waiting on

10
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.800
Open the Gantt

11
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:47.300
Month fits both tasks on the screen

12
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:57.500
An arrow runs from the task it waits for
